OL,3,GNEWSA#350k stolen racing car found
OL,4,Aafter ransom call
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stolen racing car worth about
OL,7,F#350,000 has been found, its team says,
OL,8,Fbut not before its principal got a call
OL,9,F"with somebody FaceTiming me showing me
OL,10,Fthe car trying to get the ransom".
OL,12,FBritish Touring Car Championship team
OL,13,FPower Maxed Racing in Studley,
OL,14,FWarwickshire, said its Dexter Patterson
OL,15,FBTCC Audi was taken from a compound at
OL,16,FExcel London on Wednesday night.
OL,18,FAdam Weaver stated he "basically said..
OL,19,F'it's not gonna happen tonight
OL,20,F[Thursday].. I would need to organise
OL,21,Fthe cash and I wanna sleep on it'."
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
