OL,3,GNEWSA#350k stolen racing car found
OL,4,Aafter ransom call
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the team, whose former HQ near
OL,7,FEvesham was destroyed in a fire in
OL,8,F2025, revealed he later had another
OL,9,Fcall to say "the police had been called
OL,10,Fand it was in a road still in London".
